id: cpc_ng_secondary
package: cpc_ng
description: |
  This component implements the CPC-NG Secondary (co-processor) role. It provides
  secondary-specific control-plane initialization and system management so this
  device can listen on endpoints and communicate with a CPC-NG Primary. The
  physical link is selected by a CPC-NG Secondary driver instance.

  This is the next-generation stack. It requires the CPC-NG core and is not
  compatible with the original "cpc" package.
category: Services|CPC-NG|Secondary Device
quality: experimental
label: CPC-NG Secondary Device
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
provides:
- name: cpc_ng_secondary
requires:
- name: cpc_ng
- name: cpc_ng_drv_secondary_instance
source:
- path: src/sli_cpc_control_secondary.c
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: cpc_ng_secondary
root_path: cpc_ng
